<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="uIxWj" id="uIxWj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uf45f6f02" id="uf45f6f02">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ub6a3def4" id="ub6a3def4"> 𝐌𝐄𝐃𝐔𝐒𝐀: 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐅𝐫𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐤 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐇𝐞𝐚𝐝𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u1f2a93ba" id="u1f2a93ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u78d2e37b" id="u78d2e37b">大语言模型推理主要受限于内存带宽，其主要延迟瓶颈来自加速器的内存带宽，而非算术计算。这一瓶颈根源于自回归解码固有的顺序性：每次前向传播都需要将全部模型参数从高带宽内存传输至加速器缓存。然而，这一过程仅生成一个词元，未能充分利用现代加速器的算术计算能力，因而效率低下</span></strong></p><ul list="u521723cd"><li fid="ueecb5144" data-lake-id="u87297df7" id="u87297df7"><span data-lake-id="u2797c1de" id="u2797c1de">为解决这一问题，一种加速大语言模型推理的思路是，提高解码过程的算术强度，同时减少解码步骤数。基于这一思路，研究者提出投机解码。该方法使用较小的草稿模型生成词元序列，再由原始的大模型对其进行修正，从而得到可接受的续写</span></li><li fid="ueecb5144" data-lake-id="u4d0ddd49" id="u4d0ddd49"><span data-lake-id="u12d85122" id="u12d85122">然而，获取合适的草稿模型仍然具有挑战性，而将草稿模型集成到分布式系统中则更加困难</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2eedab9c" id="u2eedab9c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5963369d" id="u5963369d">本文不再使用独立的草稿模型顺序生成候选输出，而是重新审视并改进在主干模型之上增加多个解码头以加速推理的思路。具体而言，提出 MEDUSA，通过增加额外的解码头，并行预测多个词元，从而提高大语言模型的推理效率</span></strong></p><ul list="ue15fb4ab"><li fid="uaae4e3d9" data-lake-id="u174929ff" id="u174929ff"><span data-lake-id="u47cc5c0e" id="u47cc5c0e">这些解码头采用参数高效的方式进行微调，并且可以添加到任意现有模型之上。由于无需独立的草稿模型，MEDUSA 可以方便地集成到现有的大语言模型系统中，包括分布式环境中的系统，从而提供便捷的使用体验</span></li><li fid="uaae4e3d9" data-lake-id="u79e9ce4c" id="u79e9ce4c"><span data-lake-id="u628a2732" id="u628a2732">现有方法在每个解码步骤中只生成一条候选续写，导致计算资源利用不充分。为此，提出利用 MEDUSA 头生成多条候选续写，并通过对注意力掩码进行简单调整，对这些候选进行并行验证</span></li><li fid="uaae4e3d9" data-lake-id="u9ce35287" id="u9ce35287"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93100cb0" id="u93100cb0" style="color: #5C0036">可以复用投机解码中的拒绝采样方案，使生成响应的分布与原始模型保持一致。然而，这种方案无法进一步提高加速率。作为替代，提出典型接受方案，从 MEDUSA 头的输出中选择合理的候选。使用温度作为阈值，控制相对于原始模型预测的偏离程度，为拒绝采样提供一种高效的替代方案</span></strong></li><li fid="uaae4e3d9" data-lake-id="u2404e40a" id="u2404e40a"><span data-lake-id="ucabbda6a" id="ucabbda6a">实验结果表明，所提出的典型接受方案能够在保持相近生成质量的同时，进一步提高解码速度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4703f348" id="u4703f348"><strong><span data-lake-id="u494d659f" id="u494d659f">为使大语言模型具备能够进行预测的 MEDUSA 头，针对不同应用场景提出两种微调流程</span></strong></p><ul list="u82e0f23e"><li fid="ud95f0daf" data-lake-id="u026c2dba" id="u026c2dba"><span data-lake-id="u77d4f044" id="u77d4f044">对于计算资源有限，或希望在不影响现有模型性能的前提下引入 MEDUSA 的场景，推荐使用 MEDUSA-1。该方法的内存需求较低，并且可以采用类似 QLoRA 的量化技术进一步优化；由于主干模型保持固定，因此不会损害生成质量</span></li><li fid="ud95f0daf" data-lake-id="u3bf03aa2" id="u3bf03aa2"><span data-lake-id="u4146e43b" id="u4146e43b">MEDUSA-1 尚未充分发挥主干模型潜力。可以进一步微调主干模型，提高 MEDUSA 头的预测准确率，从而直接获得更高的加速比。提出 MEDUSA-2，适用于计算资源充足，或直接对基础模型进行监督微调的场景。MEDUSA-2 的关键在于一套训练方案，使 MEDUSA 头与主干模型能够在不损害模型下一词元预测能力和输出质量的前提下进行联合训练。根据模型的训练方案及数据集的可用性，提出不同的训练数据获取策略</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u81004246" id="u81004246" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791114285613-763a2c10-c855-49ae-b251-9f218ec6eebe.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u69dbd11f-2ef9-4c01-9824-0b3d04176a8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u226df4a9-895d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A533.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A422%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A155327%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A788%2C%22originHeight%22%3A623%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTISDIFFICULTNOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A310%2C%22y%22%3A525%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEAD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SINGLESTEPPREDICTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAMEETSALLAMA%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-KPREDICTIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A566%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINALMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHATWILLHAPPENIF%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A529%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEAD2%22%2C%22x%22%3A333%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEAD3%22%2C%22x%22%3A338%2C%22y%22%3A370%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TDIFICULTAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A548%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LASTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CANDIDATES%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A497%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTIS'NOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A570%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A101%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIFICULTIS%22%2C%22x%22%3A599%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A115%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LTL%2CAS%22%2C%22x%22%3A615%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOT.DIFFICULTA%22%2C%22x%22%3A587%2C%22y%22%3A370%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%2C'%2CTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A612%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TISDIFFICULT%22%2C%22x%22%3A597%2C%22y%22%3A533%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEADS%22%2C%22x%22%3A350%2C%22y%22%3A198%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A115%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TV%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A524%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A387%2C%22y%22%3A580%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ddded7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5ffa3cfb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791114444503-9c199f01-b201-43c5-ba22-78ded1a5a47a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u154f49b6-f138-4e50-8fae-dd0cba454fc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1ea924b4-f647-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A579.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A386%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A63771%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A786%2C%22originHeight%22%3A523%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TREEMLASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HEAD2%22%2C%22x%22%3A238%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUENY%22%2C%22x%22%3A215%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HEAD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A116%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A251%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A291%2C%22y%22%3A460%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A726%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%22%2C%22x%22%3A469%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IS%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f5f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uddd3d3ec%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="bUNgd" id="bUNgd" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc4896199" id="uc4896199">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u4069c0ea" id="u4069c0ea"> 𝐊𝐞𝐲 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐨𝐧𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5908bc92" id="u5908bc92"><strong><span data-lake-id="u086c9154" id="u086c9154">MEDUSA 遵循与投机解码相同的框架，每个解码步骤主要包含三个子步骤：（1）生成候选；（2）处理候选；（3）接受候选</span></strong></p><ul list="ub6f8cb40"><li fid="u1dfac589" data-lake-id="u196036f7" id="u196036f7"><span data-lake-id="ue9f6ce7b" id="ue9f6ce7b">在 MEDUSA 中，步骤（1）由 MEDUSA 头完成，步骤（2）通过树形注意力实现。由于 MEDUSA 头位于原始模型之上，步骤（2）中计算的 logits 可以用于下一解码步骤的候选生成。最后的步骤（3）既可以通过拒绝采样实现，也可以采用典型性接受方案</span></li><li fid="u1dfac589" data-lake-id="uf2ab6c3f" id="uf2ab6c3f"><span data-lake-id="uc0799c9a" id="uc0799c9a">在投机解码中，后续词元由辅助草稿模型进行预测。该草稿模型必须足够小，同时又要具备足够的预测能力，以生成能够被原始模型接受的续写。满足这些要求并不容易，现有方法通常采用单独预训练一个较小模型的方式。这个预训练过程需要大量额外的计算资源。此外，单独预训练还可能导致草稿模型与原始模型之间出现分布偏移，使得生成的续写不符合原始模型的偏好</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub938257d" id="ub938257d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u03fc6913" id="u03fc6913" style="color: #663000">MEDUSA 头是在原始模型最后一层隐藏状态之上附加的额外解码头。给定原始模型在位置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uBpJG%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uca48d9d5" id="uca48d9d5" style="color: #663000">上的最后一层隐藏状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca57d16acf441271e4e8283f344a3f70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oCRyT%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8330e6d" id="uc8330e6d" style="color: #663000">，在其上增加</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sWTSS%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u80b72bf1" id="u80b72bf1" style="color: #663000">个解码头。第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bY9ns%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1075751d" id="u1075751d" style="color: #663000">个头用于预测位置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%2Bk%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2192612241ae17103c7d7e77be1ec9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uhnHl%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u64bac1d3" id="u64bac1d3" style="color: #663000">上的词元，而原始语言模型输出头用于预测位置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d87e290bff9b2ee05387ac4f1206f5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22obO2C%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u425b519d" id="u425b519d" style="color: #663000">上的词元</span></strong></p><ul list="uf262715d"><li fid="u3e193d03" data-lake-id="ua0455bf7" id="ua0455bf7"><span data-lake-id="u94737883" id="u94737883">将第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZCB3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u780d7f9f" id="u780d7f9f">个头的预测记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%5E%7B(k)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a05b40530c0722abf42865735eeb6e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22no7oA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8ee6024" id="uf8ee6024">，它表示词表上的概率分布；原始模型的预测则记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%5E%7B(0)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F927a169dca48fd05ef9e8be490c6af16.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w0GId%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c0e434e" id="u6c0e434e">。每个头均采用一个带残差连接的单层前馈网络</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7ca79d48" id="u7ca79d48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%5E%7B(k)%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(W_2%5E%7B(k)%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(W_1%5E%7B(k)%7D%5C%5Ccdot%20h_t%5C%5Cright)%2Bh_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71888f3e51c1b9f1454ac8efe7172b0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ctV1y%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u11603b7a"><li fid="udc325063" data-lake-id="u77c2c730" id="u77c2c730"><span data-lake-id="uff80068c" id="uff80068c">将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_2%5E%7B(k)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F104381e3934de6ce7485a748f8ac1fb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yMJGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u330a1bca" id="u330a1bca">初始化为与原始语言模型输出头相同的权重，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_1%5E%7B(k)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ff760c5e6e950201d934c8a2b67229b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tfNU7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1b7977c" id="ue1b7977c">初始化为零。这样，MEDUSA 头的初始预测便与原始模型保持一致</span></li><li fid="udc325063" data-lake-id="ub7abfea0" id="ub7abfea0"><span data-lake-id="u4dacd31a" id="u4dacd31a">与独立的草稿模型不同，MEDUSA 头依托原始主干模型进行训练；主干模型既可以在训练过程中保持冻结，即 MEDUSA-1，也可以与新增预测头共同训练，即 MEDUSA-2。该方法利用强大基础模型已经学习到的表示，使得即使在单张 GPU 上也能够完成大模型的微调。此外，它使 MEDUSA 头的分布与原始模型的分布对齐，从而缓解分布偏移问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1d4b09ae" id="u1d4b09ae"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f68d1a6" id="u6f68d1a6" style="color: #663000">通过 MEDUSA 头，可以获得后续</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18930c90f0e05329c92ff1167f80c382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gf5ID%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u68e0f7c2" id="u68e0f7c2" style="color: #663000">个词元的概率预测，并据此构造长度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18930c90f0e05329c92ff1167f80c382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vbQR3%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3137732" id="uf3137732" style="color: #663000">的候选续写。尽管投机解码研究提出仅采样一条续写作为候选，但在解码过程中使用多个候选，可以提高单个解码步骤内的期望接受长度。然而，增加候选数量也会提高计算需求。为在两者之间取得平衡，采用树结构的注意力机制，对多个候选进行并行处理</span></strong></p><ul list="u7e437ee2"><li fid="u0257dc73" data-lake-id="u725618e1" id="u725618e1"><span data-lake-id="u404dcb68" id="u404dcb68">这种注意力机制不同于传统的因果注意力：在该框架中，只有属于同一条续写路径的词元才被视为历史上下文。借助 MEDUSA 头所生成候选的结构，采用自顶向下的方式构建候选树。对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eaxuB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd5f9ca9" id="ucd5f9ca9">个预测头，其概率最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe50d8dcb9ee2e16b274f94f8d9f5f04c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J5bzZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d53f050" id="u9d53f050">个预测结果作为构造候选的基础。通过对各个头的 top-</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe50d8dcb9ee2e16b274f94f8d9f5f04c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lgpK2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1b2ae2d" id="ud1b2ae2d">预测结果求笛卡尔积，即可得到候选续写</span></li><li fid="u0257dc73" data-lake-id="u8480cce9" id="u8480cce9"><span data-lake-id="u77b1ea70" id="u77b1ea70">在这棵树中，只有某个词元的前驱节点才被视为其历史上下文，注意力掩码确保注意力仅作用于这些前驱节点。通过使用该掩码，并正确设置位置编码的位置索引，可以在不增加批量大小的情况下，同时处理多个候选。新增词元的累计数量为：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BK%7D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bk%7Ds_i.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F50132a955041427724e39ccaad2bea21.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wn8yR%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf59e970a" id="uf59e970a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u31617c5e" id="u31617c5e">在投机解码中，作者采用拒绝采样，生成与原始模型分布一致的多样化输出。然而，后续实现表明，随着采样温度升高，这种采样策略的效率会下降</span></strong></p><ul list="uc2552cd0"><li fid="u3ad6be1b" data-lake-id="u4a5f1c2c" id="u4a5f1c2c"><span data-lake-id="u4e391353" id="u4e391353">直观而言，可以通过草稿模型与原始模型完全相同这一极端情况来理解：采用贪心解码时，草稿模型的全部输出都会被接受，从而使效率最大化。相比之下，由于草稿模型与原始模型分别独立采样，拒绝采样会引入额外开销；即使两者的分布完全一致，草稿模型的输出仍可能被拒绝</span></li><li fid="u3ad6be1b" data-lake-id="ua8241226" id="ua8241226"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue371bd2d" id="ue371bd2d" style="color: #101E60">更高的温度应当为原始模型接受草稿模型的输出提供更多机会。通常没有必要严格匹配原始模型的分布。因此，提出采用典型性接受方案来选择合理的候选，而不是使用拒绝采样。目标是选择具有典型性的候选，即这些候选由原始模型生成的概率不应低得不合理。为此，使用原始模型给出的预测概率作为自然的衡量标准，并根据预测分布设定阈值，以决定是否接受候选。</span></strong></li><li fid="u3ad6be1b" data-lake-id="ube5ce5fa" id="ube5ce5fa"><span data-lake-id="uc8fe6e54" id="uc8fe6e54">具体而言，给定上下文</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2Cx_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57039d4ab8058cf973cb02786057379a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UlkVK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u841ad64e" id="u841ad64e">，在评估候选序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x_%7Bn%2B1%7D%2Cx_%7Bn%2B2%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7Bn%2BK%2B1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbecf7d6e23633ff4ce54909e8d58a6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G6gMB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab06f1f6" id="uab06f1f6">时，该序列由原始语言模型输出头和 MEDUSA 头的高概率预测结果组成，考虑以下条件：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3e371304" id="u3e371304" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Boriginal%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bn%2Bk%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7Bn%2Bk-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%3E%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5Cdelta%5C%5Cexp%5C%5Cleft(-H%5C%5Cleft(p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Boriginal%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7Bn%2Bk-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619f23d53023fe67bf6fa201aadd5e2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FPBSg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub3b37050"><li fid="u8e6607aa" data-lake-id="u8d05e97e" id="u8d05e97e"><span data-lake-id="uc4253a66" id="uc4253a66">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3918d621a408b0c421801dcd8c963f56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jrctr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufeb97f5c" id="ufeb97f5c">表示熵函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jd4mj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce216a77" id="uce216a77">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb366096db7f8095739886cce8854eaec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YqT00%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u551791e7" id="u551791e7">分别为硬阈值和熵相关阈值参数。基于两项观察：概率相对较高的词元具有合理性；当分布的熵较高时，多种续写都可能被认为是合理的。在解码过程中，使用这一判据评估每个候选；如果候选的某个前缀满足条件，就接受该前缀。为保证每个步骤至少生成一个词元，对第一个词元采用贪心解码，并无条件接受它；对于后续词元，则采用典型性接受。当前步骤的最终预测结果，由所有候选中被接受的最长前缀确定</span></li><li fid="u8e6607aa" data-lake-id="u78d9b4af" id="u78d9b4af"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66d5c3c0" id="u66d5c3c0" style="color: #101E60">首先，当温度设为 0 时，它退化为贪心解码，因为只有概率最高的词元具有非零概率。当温度大于 0 时，在适当设置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ctrxp%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u93db6345" id="u93db6345" style="color: #101E60">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb366096db7f8095739886cce8854eaec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ALFUV%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc03a7e9" id="ucc03a7e9" style="color: #101E60">的情况下，贪心解码的结果始终会被接受，因为这些词元具有最高概率，从而获得最大的加速效果。同样，在一般情况下，提高温度会相应地增加被接受序列的长度</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="DNE0O" id="DNE0O" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u882bc1d4" id="u882bc1d4">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u466c9794" id="u466c9794" style="color: #101E60"> </span><span data-lake-id="u4548aecf" id="u4548aecf">𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐢𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u9946e52c" id="u9946e52c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u652cc7cb" id="u652cc7cb" style="color: #665800">在冻结主干模型的情况下，使用 MEDUSA 头的预测结果与真实标签之间的交叉熵损失进行训练。具体而言，给定位置</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%2Bk%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2192612241ae17103c7d7e77be1ec9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rNXXa%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ed97012" id="u5ed97012" style="color: #665800">上的真实词元</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_%7Bt%2Bk%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59e81a41c3a4367160768c21a5cb4933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rFK4b%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2beb644" id="ud2beb644" style="color: #665800">，第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tVY3h%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucab270c6" id="ucab270c6" style="color: #665800">个预测头的损失为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_k%3D-%5C%5Clog%20p_t%5E%7B(k)%7D(y_%7Bt%2Bk%2B1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fddf2dcabd260ffa01fd35fbf83ed1330.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UkQhQ%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9e57499" id="ub9e57499" style="color: #665800">，其中，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t%5E%7B(k)%7D(y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F594e29de1d8636047a2eff5d2914214b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EoO5I%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2f262b0" id="uc2f262b0" style="color: #665800">表示第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RO4Zb%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a3acc74" id="u2a3acc74" style="color: #665800">个预测头为词元</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tr0yv%22%7D" style="color: #665800"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u534d1652" id="u534d1652" style="color: #665800">分配的概率</span></strong></p><ul list="u6bddc8b2"><li fid="uf41a6b46" data-lake-id="ua8b0da7c" id="ua8b0da7c"><span data-lake-id="u591753bc" id="u591753bc">观察到，随着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kjXGe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76a16de2" id="u76a16de2">增大，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52f0760b950eb0bcf795553eab7f7001.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xokK8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0755a6e9" id="u0755a6e9">也会增大。这是合理的，因为预测位置越远，第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub48L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud30f97bc" id="ud30f97bc">个预测头所面临的不确定性就越大。因此，可以为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52f0760b950eb0bcf795553eab7f7001.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n72aw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4948b5a" id="uc4948b5a">引入权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf81d3f2585529961145d5a6dc8ce4de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22go6TL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8eaf8dbb" id="u8eaf8dbb">，以平衡不同预测头的损失。MEDUSA 的总损失为：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6bc2ba1c" id="u6bc2ba1c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMEDUSA%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7D1%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BK%7D-%5C%5Clambda_k%5C%5Clog%20p_t%5E%7B(k)%7D%5C%5Cleft(y_%7Bt%2Bk%2B1%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f1bba1ebc83cc0c5c3f0692e8af9598.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t5HE9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ued315dca"><li fid="ud7c9d193" data-lake-id="u821b9e38" id="u821b9e38"><span data-lake-id="u690395e3" id="u690395e3">在实际应用中，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf81d3f2585529961145d5a6dc8ce4de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v0fNT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05bf4292" id="u05bf4292">设置为某个常数的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JbRAf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e0af063" id="u5e0af063">次幂。由于主干模型仅用于提供隐藏状态，因此可以使用量化后的主干模型来降低显存占用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u78348d38" id="u78348d38"><strong><span data-lake-id="u45b3763c" id="u45b3763c" style="color: #665800">为进一步提高 MEDUSA 头的预测准确率，可以将 MEDUSA 头与主干模型联合训练。然而，这需要专门的训练方案，以保持主干模型的下一词元预测能力和输出质量。为此，提出以下三项策略</span></strong></p><ul list="u7cbe036b"><li fid="ua76228fe" data-lake-id="u6e8de578" id="u6e8de578"><strong><span data-lake-id="uacd13d67" id="uacd13d67">联合损失：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ued53db00" id="ued53db00">为保持主干模型的下一词元预测能力，需要在 MEDUSA 损失中加入主干模型的交叉熵损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BLM%7D%7D%3D-%5C%5Clog%20p_t%5E%7B(0)%7D(y_%7Bt%2B1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe99a4ed856583c56da7653e1c5c4828b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hs9wl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26f11f1c" id="u26f11f1c">。引入权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5e2e3fde9e07afbcfe79d7370f8d579.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hyBEX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab58f410" id="uab58f410">，以平衡主干模型与 MEDUSA 头的损失。因此，总损失为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6105e482" id="u6105e482" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMEDUSA%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7D2%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BLM%7D%7D%2B%5C%5Clambda_0%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BMEDUSA%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7D1%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbbb8682a94b6ec438a800b43ca03ef7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g0VOw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u79a62ea7"><li fid="u3b38eb72" data-lake-id="u1348067e" id="u1348067e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud166a699" id="ud166a699">差异化学习率：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7bf972a" id="ue7bf972a">由于主干模型已经得到充分训练，而 MEDUSA 头仍需要更多训练，因此可以为二者分别设置学习率，使 MEDUSA 头更快收敛，同时保持主干模型的能力</span></li><li fid="u3b38eb72" data-lake-id="u16d27ee4" id="u16d27ee4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5e89053c" id="u5e89053c">预测头预热：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uecda3717" id="uecda3717">在训练初期，MEDUSA 头的损失较大，由此产生的较大梯度可能扰乱主干模型的参数。借鉴 Kumar et al. 的思路，可以采用两阶段训练过程。在第一阶段，与 MEDUSA-1 相同，仅训练 MEDUSA 头。在第二阶段，结合预热策略，对主干模型和 MEDUSA 头进行联合训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u11898a9a" id="u11898a9a"><br></p>